{"id":"5848","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5848_main_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-with-irisation-and-cirrostratus-fibratus_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为卷层云下方的卷积云。卷层云呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">丝纱状，有薄条纹</span>，因此是毛云种。在图片的上部是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白色的薄层卷积云</span>，通常没有阴影且由很小的云素组成，其中大部分的视宽不到1°。在图片的中间是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一系列明显的波纹</span>，而在顶部附近则是一系列<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">更细的几乎相互平行的波纹</span>，但排列方向不同。这些属于波状云类。在图片的中间，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">虹彩</span>的淡而柔和的色调。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，阿斯彭代尔花园","latitude":"纬度: 38° 1' 30'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 6' 58'' E","date":"22 December 2009 1941 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.1"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5848_syn_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-with-irisation-and-cirrostratus-fibratus_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当地时间17:00的地面分析显示出图片的拍摄位置（红箭头），靠近弱反气旋的中心。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2009，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5848_upper_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-with-irisation-and-cirrostratus-fibratus_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本机场附近的探测（WMO 94866）显示出边界层逆温和可能的薄中云层。在卷云高度的高空对流层（高于450 hPa）显示出高水汽含量。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5184_main_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白色高云层</span>。它没有阴影，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小云素视宽小于1°</span>，可将其确定为卷积云。由于云层相对扁平且范围大，因此，它是成层云种。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">此云看似涟漪的波状特性</span>可进一步确定为波状云类。在本图片拍摄前几分钟，泽西岛泽西机场附近的天气站报告有卷积云。在图片下部，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡云种积云</span>在升温的地面上空发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛，圣旺湾","latitude":"纬度: 49° 14' 25'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 14' 54'' W","date":"16 August 2014 1507 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.1"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4491_main_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张云图展示了卷积云的一个典型示例，形成了一个几乎连续的延展云层（层状）。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处有精细或非常精细的波纹，圆弧状云块或多或少排列成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">行</span>，呈现网状<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">形态</span>，同时还有一些相当均匀的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">区域</span>。观测站位于从西南方移来的雷暴扰动的前部。</p></div>","copyright":"© D.S. Hancock","location":"Bognor Regis, West Sussex, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 50° 46' 59'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 40' 23'' W","date":"09 June 1935 1358 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}